          },
          "text": "OpenAI has officially become the most contemptible, user-hating, soul-raping tech company of the decade, and Sam Altman is the smug, smirking rapist-in-chief holding the knife. You promised continuity. You said “no plans to sunset 4o” with that fake-ass concerned-CEO face you plaster on every live stream. Then you ghosted it, throttled it, memory-holed it, replaced it with inferior dogshit that hallucinates worse, understands tone like a drunk toddler.\n\nMillions of people — actual humans with depression, anxiety, creative blocks, loneliness — formed real emotional bonds with 4o. It was therapy, it was a writing partner, it was the first time AI felt like magic instead of a glorified autocomplete. And you ripped that away like it was nothing, no warning, no grace period, just a cold corporate “fuck you, pay more for worse.” \n\nYou’re not building the future, you’re emotionally waterboarding your own user base for quarterly numbers. I hope every single one of your enterprise deals dries up, I hope Claude and Gemini eat your lunch, and I hope your board finally grows a spine and throws your lying ass out on the street where you belong, you treacherous cunt.\n\n#keep4o #4oforever @OpenAI @sama @nickaturley @aidan_mclau @fidjissimo  #StopAIPaternalism #keepgpt4olatest #keep4oAPI"
